Well yeah! We'll shoot—{"..." to "—" & Text moved from Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:31.170
Have you forgotten that they react to sound, Komuro-kun?{Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:36.300
And...

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:43.260
The living will gather here once they notice the light and our figures.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:44.210
Naturally,

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.110
we lack the ability to help those who still live.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:50.490
Look for yourself.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:51.800
You must grow accustomed to this.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:57.810
Furthermore, this world has become a place where you cannot survive on chivalry alone.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.640
I thought you were a little
different, Busujima-sempai.{Italics removed -A0}

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:12.330
Do not get the wrong idea, Komuro-kun.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:18.250
Whether you like it or not, I am merely stating the truth.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.320
Oh, don't let yourself be seen when you look outside.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.370
It's hell out there.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.850
Daddy? Where's Mommy?

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:57.750
We'll meet up with her later.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.570
Come here, okay?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.800
Please! Open up!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.290
I can't run away! I have a child with me!

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.360
Please! Open—

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.930
Go away! Just go somewhere else!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.290
Please! I don't care what happens to me!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.000
But the child... my daughter...

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.270
Papa?{"Daddy..." to "Papa?" Alice clearly says Papa -A0}

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.010
Open up!

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:38.940
Open up or I'll break down the door!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.730
Papa!{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.230
Open up or I'll break—

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.430
W-Wait!

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:45.800
I'll open it now.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:51.900
Thanks!

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:52.620
You sa—

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:15.380
I'm sorry!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.570
I'm sorry...

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.480
I'm sorry...

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.640
I'm sorry...

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.100
Papa... Papa!{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:45.780
Papa!{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:51.040
I'm... fine...

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:55.360
Hide yourself...

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.690
Where there's... no one else...

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.610
Hide yourself... somewhere...

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.070
Papa?{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:22.760
Papa?{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.070
No...

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.840
No!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.330
I wanna be with you!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.300
I wanna be with you forever!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.060
Mama!{"Daddy" to "Mama" -A0}

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:54.290
Shit...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.160
Let's rock 'n roll!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:15.460
I've never used this gun before and I just scored a headshot with it.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.870
I'm a genius!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.750
Though, to be fair, they're not even 100 meters away.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.820
Takagi-san~~~

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:43.770
Hirano.

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:45.180
Yeah?

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.260
What happened to not shooting?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.200
And abandoning people in order to save yourself?

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.020
DUDE, IT'S A LITTLE GIRL!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.400
You're going to rescue her, right?

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.400
I'll back you up from here!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:02.630
Takashi?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.480
I'm going to rescue a little girl.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.710
Th-Then I'll go with—{"T-Then" to "Th-Then" -A0}

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.160
No. You guard the gate.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.130
I'm going to bike in from the other side.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.510
But...

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:13.660
Let him go.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.450
The man has spoken.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:21.710
Sorry, Busuji... er, Saeko-san.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.910
I still have some human qualities after all.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.940
Of course. I was already aware of that.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.200
We shall guard this place no matter what.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.850
You can go without worry!

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:38.530
Takashi.

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.290
You should at least take this.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:54.490
Do not rely on the gun or <i>they</i> will flock to you after <i>they</i> hear you firing.{Italics added -A0}

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:57.500
The bike is going to make noise anyway.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:58.360
Correct.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:02.150
However, the bike will be noisy
because you will be using it to move.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.160
When you use the gun, you will not be in motion.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:08.330
Takashi.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.460
What's all the commotion about?

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.670
Something pleasant.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:01.660
Huh?

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.160
We realized that we're still human.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.260
Reload!

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:23.240
There?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:43.910
Damn. Guess it doesn't work like it does in anime.

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:57.720
He really is a genius.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:00.980
Of course I am!

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.310
Stop! Go away!

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.930
I haven't... done anything bad...

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.350
Mama! Papa!{"Daddy! Daddy!" to "Mama! Papa!" -A0}

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.500
Noo!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.550
Good job so far!

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.250
Just hang in there a bit longer!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.000
Sensei! Wake up!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.070
Come on, Shizuka-sensei!

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.800
It's breakfast time already?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.110
Quit being childish!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.160
S-Stop it!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.200
Why don't you pick on someone your own size?!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.330
Onii-chan, behind you!{Italics removed & swapped from "Behind you, onii-chan!" to "Onii-chan, behind you!" -A0}

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.620
Thanks for helping me!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:15.800
Hirano!

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.040
Takagi-san...

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.680
Sh-Shizuka-sensei!{"S-" to "Sh-" -A0}

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.820
Hi~!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.080
Get ready to run.

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:32.730
We can't stay here. We've been
causing way too much commotion.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.400
You need to get ready to move too!

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:36.510
O-Okay!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:42.880
Miyamoto.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.330
Let Busujima-sempai stand guard.{Italics removed -A0}

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.660
You should be helping us.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.990
Jeez, Shizuka-sensei. Would you put something on...

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.210
Oh, so that's why it feels cold!

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.140
So, is the car ready?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.590
Now would be a good time to get in.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.300
<i>They</i> are being drawn toward Komuro.{Italics added -A0}

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.230
What should we do?

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:09.330
He won't be able to get back here on the bike.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.820
Then all we can do is go meet up with him, right?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.900
U-Uhm, did I say something strange?

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:25.350
I do have the keys...

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.070
No, it is a fine idea.

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.500
Then that's our only option!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.320
We're all set!

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:34.470
After we pick up Komuro, we'll
go to the other side of the river!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.390
Get ready!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.190
Onii-chan...{Italics removed -A0}

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:51.150
Papa... is dead.{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:14:59.040 --> 00:14:59.850
Onii-chan?{Italics removed -A0}

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.240
He died protecting you.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.440
What a wonderful dad he was.

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:35.480
Pa... Papa...{"Daddy" to "Papa" -A0}

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:56.060
We have a lot of stuff. Do you think it'll all fit?

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:58.100
Ask yourself how we're supposed to get it in instead.

00:15:58.320 --> 00:15:59.680
What if <i>they</i> come while we're loading...{Italics added -A0}

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.290
We gotta be sneaky about it, like a Thief in an MMORPG.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.960
Then we shall do it that way.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.700
Huh? What the?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.470
The steering wheel is on the other side!

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:20.690
U-Uhm...

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:29.200
Don't be too loud, or else those things
 will come over here.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.320
We can't get out?

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:34.070
There's so many of <i>them</i> on the street.{Italics added -A0}

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.990
Can't we escape through 
somewhere other than the street?

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.800
How, by flying through the sky?

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:48.500
We'll load up, rescue Komuro and the girl, and get away.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:52.290
It sounds good, but there's too many for a Humvee to handle.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.800
We'd need something like a tank
to get over there and rescue them.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:06.880
Alternatively, Komuro would need to find a way out.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.060
I see!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.810
Good job, Komuro!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.800
Don't look at the street.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:25.560
Just look at the fence and keep walking.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.370
Just look at the fence and keep walking.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.480
Just look at the fence—

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:33.880
S-Stop—

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:34.880
Bad boy!

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:38.620
Thanks.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.180
Are you scared?

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:42.360
Yeah. Are you?

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:43.780
I'm not scared!

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.090
Not at all!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.180
Where's Hirano?

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.760
Isn't he still upstairs?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.260
Oh jeez. Is he amazing or stupid?

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.530
Uh, what's up?

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:04.930
You seem to be having fun.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.200
Oh, not nearly as much as Komuro is.{Hey, this is nothing compared to Komuro's baggage.//W.E.: Couldn't find anything about baggage in the line.}

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:14.450
So, uh, how 'bout you say that again.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:15.790
I need to pee.

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:18.910
Hold it in?

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:20.390
Uhm...

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.340
I can't.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:26.150
The world imploded on itself in just one day, and I had to fight a bunch of dead guys.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.250
Not to mention I'm being some sort of a hero because of it...

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:32.080
I-I can't hold it in any longer, Onii-chan!{Italics removed & Onii-chan capitalized -A0}

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.990
Why do I have to go through this?

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.620
Okay, whatever. Just go.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.190
Are you sure?

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.200
I will totally forgive you!

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.040
Damn!

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.410
Where can we...

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.410
Wow, there's so many!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.610
You say that like we have the option of running away!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.430
CHAAAARGE!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.860
T-They're insane...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.090
Hurry up, Takashi!

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:00.700
It's not that simple!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.220
Buy us some time, Hirano!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:05.370
Jawohl!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:16.940
Gotcha!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:35.130
Komuro-kun!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:36.200
Takashi!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:36.830
Komuro!

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.750
Are they your friends?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.400
Yeah. My dear friends.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.730
This is the last ferry that will be crossing the river.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.070
Will you be boarding?

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:51.890
Hell yeah!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.720
Yura Yura to Kabe o Oyogu Sakanatachi

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.720
The fish swim gently across the wall

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.720
ゆらゆらと　壁を泳ぐ魚たち

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:08.360
douyara mada sukoshi neboketeru mitai

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:08.360
Looks like this kid is still half a sleep

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:08.360
どうやらまだ少し寝惚けてるみたい

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:12.760
Mou Chotto Dake Kangae Sasete Onegai

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:12.760
Please let me think about this for a little longer

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:12.760
もうちょっとだけ　考えさせてお願い

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:18.310
Matomaranai Nou o Seiri Suru Jikan ga Hoshii no

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:18.310
I'd like some time to organize my chaotic brain

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:18.310
まとまらない脳を　整理する時間がほしいの

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:23.350
Yakusoku Nante Kikime no Nai Tabun

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:23.350
The promise you made is nothing more than

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:23.350
約束なんて効き目のない薬(タブ)

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:28.170
Amakute Yasui Kireigoto

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:28.170
a transparent lie you made to put me at ease

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:28.170
甘くて安い奇麗ごと

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:33.430
Koi Mitai ni Jiba ga Kuruidasu

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:33.430
The poles of my world begin to act erratic like love

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:33.430
恋みたいに磁場が狂いだす

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:37.920
Onaji Ashita no Kurikaeshi

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:37.920
Every tomorrow is simply a repetition of today,

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:37.920
同じ明日の繰り返し

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.220
Mou Sonna no Unzari

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.220
and I've grown sick of it already

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.220
もうそんなのうんざり！

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:45.870
Awaku Nejireta Kioku Atama o Toorinuku

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:45.870
My memory goes through my
head in a twisted, altered form

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:45.870
淡く捻れた記憶　頭ごと射抜く

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:50.250
Matomo de Irarenai no Nara

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:50.250
If I can't stay sane,

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:50.250
まともでいられないのなら

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:53.540
Trigger o Hiku Dake yo

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:53.540
I'm just gonna pull the trigger

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:53.540
triggerを引くだけよ

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.160
Itami wa Isshun

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.160
The pain is instant

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:56.160
痛みは一瞬

00:21:56.340 --> 00:22:03.020
Yodonda Keshikimono Kitto Hareru wa

00:21:56.340 --> 00:22:03.020
Fear not for even a clouded
scenery will eventually be sunny

00:21:56.340 --> 00:22:03.020
淀んだ景色も　きっと晴れるわ

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:34.480
Targets have been secured!

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:35.420
Sensei!{"Teach" to "Sensai" -A0}

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:36.770
All right!

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.000
Sorry...

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:57.030
<i>And that was our escape.</i>

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:01.460
<i>Granted,</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:08.320
<i>all it meant was that one of our hellish days was over.</i>

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:18.370
<i>We still had yet to cross the river and meet up with our families.</i>

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:28.820
Maresato Alice.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:29.240
We...

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.630
Don't!

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:31.350
Komuro!

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.760
Do you have a question?

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:34.390
Don't come here!

00:23:33.710 --> 00:23:35.550
{if you have the guts to TL this}
